        <mxCell id="lane-15" value="Graph State&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5F6B7A;&quot;&gt;Temporary layer opacity state and focus mode&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=40;rounded=0;shadow=0;horizontal=1;container=1;collapsible=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;strokeColor=#54A24B;fillColor=#EDF7ED;fontColor=#1F1F1F;" parent="layer-14" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="784" width="1024" height="314" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node-16" value="&lt;div style=&quot;margin:0;padding:0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:10px 12px;background:#EDF7ED;border-bottom:2px solid #54A24B;&quot;&gt;Graph.setLayerFocusMode(allOpaque, quiet)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#5F6B7A;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;Inputs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;allOpaque&lt;/span&gt;: Whether all layers remain fully opaque&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;quiet&lt;/span&gt;: Suppress event emission and avoid external refresh noise&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px;border-top:1px solid #D7DCE3;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#5F6B7A;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;Core Logic&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;#8226; Switch between all-opaque mode and current-layer focus mode&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;#8226; Reset the opaque-layer whitelist when mode changes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;#8226; Seed whitelist with current default parent when entering focused mode&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;#8226; Apply opacity and emit layerOpacityChanged unless quiet&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px;border-top:1px solid #D7DCE3;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#5F6B7A;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;Outputs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;layerFocusAllOpaque&lt;/span&gt;: Updated focus mode flag&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#54A24B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F1F1F;spacing=0;" parent="lane-15" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="64" width="320" height="226" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node-17" value="&lt;div style=&quot;margin:0;padding:0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:10px 12px;background:#EDF7ED;border-bottom:2px solid #54A24B;&quot;&gt;Graph.setLayerManualOpacity(layer, enabled)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#5F6B7A;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;Inputs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;layer&lt;/span&gt;: Target layer cell&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;enabled&lt;/span&gt;: Whether the layer should be manually dimmed&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px;border-top:1px solid #D7DCE3;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#5F6B7A;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;Core Logic&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;#8226; Initialize the manual opacity map if missing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;#8226; Add or remove the layer id in that map&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;#8226; Re-apply opacity to rendered states&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;#8226; Emit layerOpacityChanged to refresh UI consumers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px;border-top:1px solid #D7DCE3;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#5F6B7A;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;Outputs&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;manualLayerOpacity&lt;/span&gt;: Updated per-layer temporary dimming map&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#54A24B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F1F1F;spacing=0;" parent="lane-15" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="372" y="64" width="320" height="226" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="node-18" value="&lt;div style=&quot;margin:0;padding:0;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:10px 12px;background:#EDF7ED;border-bottom:2px solid #54A24B;&quot;&gt;manualLayerOpacity&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#5F6B7A;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;Fields&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;layerId&lt;/span&gt;: Root layer cell id&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;enabled&lt;/span&gt;: Whether temporary dimming is enabled for that layer&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding:8px 10px;border-top:1px solid #D7DCE3;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#5F6B7A;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;&quot;&gt;Flow&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Source&lt;/span&gt;: LayersFormatPanel / LayersWindow / createLayersDialog&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;Target&lt;/span&gt;: Graph.applyLayerOpacity&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#54A24B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F1F1F;spacing=0;" parent="lane-15" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="64" width="280" height="152" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
